{"title":"Alabama mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Alabama's math competition community is fairly large and active and there are a number of quality contests around the state for both middle and high school students.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Alabama_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alabama middle school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alabama_high_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alabama high school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Alabama_collegiate_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alabama collegiate mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#National_math_contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National math contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alabama_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\">Alabama middle school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Alabama middle school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=298\">middle school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://Perennialmath.com/tournaments\">UAH Math Tournament</a> -- Grades 4 - 8</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_MathCounts\" title=\"Alabama MathCounts\">Alabama MathCounts</a> -- part of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> competition.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ala-La-Miss_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Ala-La-Miss Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">Ala-La-Miss Mathematics League</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_School_of_Fine_Arts\" title=\"Alabama School of Fine Arts\">Alabama School of Fine Arts</a> -- 6th grade, Pre-Algebra, Algebra I. Geometry (coming 2015)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cedar_Ridge_Middle&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Cedar Ridge Middle (page does not exist)\">Cedar Ridge Middle</a> -- Grades 6 - 8</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hoover_Middle_School_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Hoover Middle School Tournament (page does not exist)\">Hoover Middle School Tournament</a> -- Grades 6 - 8</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hoover_High_School\" title=\"Hoover High School\">Hoover High School</a> -- Grades 7-12</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Muscle_Shoals_Middle_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Muscle Shoals Middle Tournament (page does not exist)\">Muscle Shoals Middle Tournament</a> -- Grades 6 - 8</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pizitz_Middle_School_Math_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Pizitz Middle School Math Tournament (page does not exist)\">Pizitz Middle School Math Tournament</a> -- Grades 6 - 8</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Randolph_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Randolph School (page does not exist)\">Randolph School</a> -- Grades 5 - 6</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vestavia_Hills_High_School_Math_Tournament\" title=\"Vestavia Hills High School Math Tournament\">Vestavia Hills High School Math Tournament</a>-- Grades 7-12.  The VHHS tournament is one of the nation's largest local math tournaments, drawing around 1700 students annually.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=West_Point_Middle_School_Math_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"West Point Middle School Math Tournament (page does not exist)\">West Point Middle School Math Tournament</a> -- Grades 6 - 8</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alabama_high_school_mathematics_competitions\">Alabama high school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Alabama high school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=214\">high school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_ARML\" title=\"Alabama ARML\">Alabama ARML</a> team travels to the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Regions_Math_League\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"American Regions Math League\">American Regions Math League</a> annually with good results historically.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest\" title=\"Alabama Statewide High School Mathematics Contest\">Alabama Statewide High School Mathematics Contest</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mcis.jsu.edu/mathcontest/\">website</a> -- One of the harder and higher quality local math contests in the U.S.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ala-La-Miss_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Ala-La-Miss Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">Ala-La-Miss Mathematics League</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_School_of_Fine_Arts\" title=\"Alabama School of Fine Arts\">Alabama School of Fine Arts</a> -- 6th grade, Pre-Algebra, Algebra I. Geometry (coming 2015)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Auburn_High_School_Math_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Auburn High School Math Tournament (page does not exist)\">Auburn High School Math Tournament</a> -- Algebra – Comprehensive</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hoover_High_School\" title=\"Hoover High School\">Hoover High School</a> -- Grades 7-12</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mobile_Math_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mobile Math Olympiad (page does not exist)\">Mobile Math Olympiad</a> -- Winners are invited to a national competition. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.southalabama.edu/mathstat/info/schedules/aaamath-olympiad.shtml\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Alabama_High_School_Math_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"University of Alabama High School Math Tournament (page does not exist)\">University of Alabama High School Math Tournament</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ctl.ua.edu/mathtournament/browsetournament.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Alabama-Birmingham_Math_Talent_Search&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"University of Alabama-Birmingham Math Talent Search (page does not exist)\">University of Alabama-Birmingham Math Talent Search</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.math.uab.edu/ablokh/outreach.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vestavia_Hills_High_School_Math_Tournament\" title=\"Vestavia Hills High School Math Tournament\">Vestavia Hills High School Math Tournament</a>-- Grades 7-12.  The VHHS tournament is one of the nation's largest local math tournaments, drawing around 1700 students annually.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Virgil_Grissom_High_School_Math_Tournament\" title=\"Virgil Grissom High School Math Tournament\">Virgil Grissom High School Math Tournament</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alabama_collegiate_mathematics_competitions\">Alabama collegiate mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Alabama collegiate mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chris_Nash_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Chris Nash Competition (page does not exist)\">Chris Nash Competition</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Alabama&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"University of South Alabama (page does not exist)\">University of South Alabama</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.southalabama.edu/mathstat/info/schedules/aaanash.shtml\">website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_math_contests\">National math contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: National math contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions resources\">Mathematics competitions resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017085638\nCache expiry: 86400\nRed